    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-axiom-intro",
        "moduleId": "axiom-system",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "公理系统的引入",
        "markdown": "教材提出，为了从已知的函数依赖推导出其他函数依赖，需要一套推理规则。Armstrong公理系统是一套有效且完备的推理规则集，由自反律、增广律和传递律三条基本规则组成。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000381"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "数据依赖的公理系统"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6997,
              "lineEnd": 7188,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0003/images/a2e40159f10b5d7698b2714afc315aeb80fd4fcf68c263d89b772b5ef96f1efe.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "6811c8380155590a9dacde280a18a447fddd4b8a63627bbba706d82cf0007950"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-axiom-rules",
        "moduleId": "axiom-system",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "三条基本推理规则",
        "markdown": "设 $F$ 是属性集 $U$ 上的函数依赖集，有以下规则：\n\n- **自反律（Reflexivity）**：若 $Y \\subseteq X \\subseteq U$，则 $X \\rightarrow Y$ 为 $F$ 所逻辑蕴涵。\n- **增广律（Augmentation）**：若 $X \\rightarrow Y$ 为 $F$ 所逻辑蕴涵，且 $Z \\subseteq U$，则 $XZ \\rightarrow YZ$ 为 $F$ 所逻辑蕴涵。\n- **传递律（Transitivity）**：若 $X \\rightarrow Y$ 和 $Y \\rightarrow Z$ 都为 $F$ 所逻辑蕴涵，则 $X \\rightarrow Z$ 为 $F$ 所逻辑蕴涵。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-axiom-intro"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-closure",
        "moduleId": "closure-calculation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "属性集闭包",
        "markdown": "教材定义：设 $F$ 为属性集 $U$ 上的一组函数依赖，$X \\subseteq U$，则称 $X_F^+ = \\{ A \\mid X \\rightarrow A \\text{ 能由 } F \\text{ 根据Armstrong公理导出} \\}$ 为属性集 $X$ 关于函数依赖集 $F$ 的闭包。利用闭包可以方便地判断 $X \\rightarrow Y$ 是否能由 $F$ 导出：只需检查 $Y \\subseteq X_F^+$ 是否成立。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000382"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "\\*6.4 模式的分解"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7189,
              "lineEnd": 7204,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "94bd0dac5c254f589d6612b44d24125bfedf8a5748f500131da6b5644fbbb9ad"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-closure-example",
        "moduleId": "closure-calculation",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "闭包计算示例",
        "markdown": "设 $U = \\{A,B,C,D,E\\}$，$F = \\{A \\rightarrow B, B \\rightarrow C, D \\rightarrow E\\}$。求 $A_F^+$。\n\n1. 初始：$A_F^+ = \\{A\\}$。\n2. 由 $A \\rightarrow B$，得 $A_F^+ = \\{A,B\\}$。\n3. 由 $B \\rightarrow C$，得 $A_F^+ = \\{A,B,C\\}$。\n4. 无法再扩展，故 $A_F^+ = \\{A,B,C\\}$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-closure"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-decomp-def",
        "moduleId": "min-cover",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "模式分解的三个定义",
        "markdown": "教材给出模式分解的三个关键定义：\n\n1. **无损连接性**：分解后的关系通过自然连接能完全恢复原关系，不丢失信息。\n2. **保持函数依赖性**：分解后各关系模式上的函数依赖之逻辑蕴涵与原依赖集等价。\n3. **分解算法**：基于函数依赖和范式要求，将关系模式逐步分解至目标范式。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000383"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "模式分解的三个定义"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7205,
              "lineEnd": 7274,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "d9150c49fab8ded5958b728a52679c8e72d715991a8ee50eda0711423790aefe"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-lossless-preserve",
        "moduleId": "min-cover",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "无损连接性与保持函数依赖性",
        "markdown": "教材讨论了判定分解是否满足无损连接性和保持函数依赖性的方法。无损连接性可通过 chase 算法或表格法检验；保持函数依赖性则要求分解后的依赖集之并集逻辑蕴涵原依赖集中的每一条依赖。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000384"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "分解的无损连接性和保持函数依赖性"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7275,
