        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-min-cover",
        "moduleId": "min-cover",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "最小覆盖构造步骤",
        "markdown": "最小覆盖（minimum cover）需满足：\n\n1. 右部单一：每个函数依赖的右部只有一个属性。\n2. 无冗余依赖：删除任一依赖后，依赖集不等价。\n3. 左部无冗余属性：每个依赖的左部没有可删除的属性。\n\n构造步骤：先将右部分解为单属性，再逐个检查并删除冗余依赖，最后检查左部冗余属性。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-decomp-algo",
            "tb-closure"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "exercise-check",
        "moduleId": "check",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "自检题",
        "markdown": "给定 $U = \\{A,B,C,D\\}$，$F = \\{A \\rightarrow BC, B \\rightarrow C, A \\rightarrow B, AB \\rightarrow C, AC \\rightarrow D\\}$。\n\n1. 求 $A_F^+$。\n2. 构造 $F$ 的一个最小覆盖。\n3. 判断分解 $\\rho = \\{R_1(A,B), R_2(B,C), R_3(A,D)\\}$ 是否保持函数依赖。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-closure",
            "tb-decomp-algo",
            "tb-lossless-preserve"
          ]
        }
      }
